# Gate step 1956-bh6j — the ComfyUI studio's custom nodes and weights stay
# pinned and licence-checked: every custom-nodes.toml node has a commit, a lock
# and a licence; no weight row names RMBG or InsightFace; every aux weight has
# its folder in the studio's extra_model_paths.yaml. Pure fs reads, no spawn.
#
# STEP_LUA is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking the studio's custom-node and weight pins (1956-bh6j)"
STEP_LUA="scripts/lua/test-studio-node-pins.lua"
STEP_ERROR="a studio node is unpinned, a weight names RMBG/InsightFace, or an aux weight has no folder in extra_model_paths.yaml (1956-bh6j) — see the FAIL lines above"
STEP_OK="Studio node and weight pins passed"
